# dotfiles

> Personal dotfiles for Fedora + Hyprland (uwsm-managed).  
> Forked from [melatonia/meloworld-dotfiles](https://github.com/melatonia/meloworld-dotfiles).

---

## About

These configs are tailored for my setup:

- Fedora Linux
- Hyprland with **uwsm session manager**
- Fish shell
- Kitty terminal
- QuickShell panel, launcher and wisgets

> ⚠️ If you use a different setup or a standard Hyprland session, adjustments may be required for full functionality.
